    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP The Property Specialists are delighted to bring no. 29 Eden Court to the market. This 4 bedroom property is a wonderful opportunity to purchase an ideal family home in a much sought after location. 29 Eden Court offers a blank canvas for any prospective new occupants to modernize and develop the property throughout. The property will appeal to all first time buyers and second time buyers alike. \n\nFeatures include a sunny rear garden, feature fireplace, fitted kitchen and private parking in driveway plus off street parking. The accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, living room, kitchen / dining room and W.C, with a small porch area at rear garden, while upstairs there are 4 very spacious bedrooms, with master en suite and a family bathroom.\nAn enclosed rear garden provides an ideal setting for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. \n\nEden Court is situated in a highly regarded and much sought after mature residential development and located approximately 6.5 miles from Dublin City Centre. \n\nThe location simply could not be better boasting numerous local amenities on the doorstep including walks in Marlay and St. Endas Park, as well as the Dublin Mountains just a short drive away. A number of exceptional primary and secondary schools are within easy reach including Divine Word National School, Scoil Naithi, Wesley College and Beaufort. Nearby sports clubs for an added bonus include Ballinteer St. Johns GAA Club, Broadford Rovers Football Club, and Grange Golf Club.\nThere are a myriad of shopping facilities at Marley, Dundrum, Rathfarnham and Ballinteer shopping centres are all within a short distance of the property. The area is serviced by excellent transport with many bus routes and direct access to the M50 motorway, and very close to the Balally Luas stop. Viewing is highly advised and strictly by appointment only.\n\n\n"
      },
